  "limits": [
    "Mouse left-button clicks and touch taps through Godot's GUI; keyboard activation, focus and accessibility are not implemented.",
    "The track and thumb are custom-drawn without animation or thumb dragging; defaults are fixed light gray/green/white and a disabled switch is drawn at half opacity.",
    "The 63x28 default frame follows RN on iOS 26.3.1 (iOS 18.4 gives 51x31); Android's AndroidSwitch path and per-target defaults are not used.",
    "After a Switch renders, RN's global registry makes topChange bubble for GodotControl TextInput too, as RN's own TextInput configs do.",
    "Headless macOS only; the iOS static build, hardware input, mobile exports and performance remain open. No whole GF, checkpoint, dependency, weight or denominator closed."
  ],
